  "description": "One day, a near-death experience causes Loelline Deaz to remember her past life, awakening the power to see the future through her dreams. However, there is one vision in particular that weighs on her the most-- she foresees the murder of the empire’s hero, Duke Dante Van Benerit! Loelline is the only one who can save the duke, but as she gets closer to uncovering the conspiracy behind his demise, she realizes that her past may have more to do with the grim future than she could’ve ever dreamed…\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
